.SS "#define VERUM_ASCON_AEAD128_ASSOCIATED_DATA_DEF"

.PP
\fR#include <\fBverum/ascon/aead\&.h\fP>\fP
.PP
Enable associated-data processing in Ascon-AEAD128\&. When defined, the \fRVERUM_ASCON_AEAD128_encrypt\fP and \fRVERUM_ASCON_AEAD128_decrypt\fP functions accept two additional parameters — \fRassociated_data\fP and \fRassociated_size\fP — and authenticate that data as part of tag generation\&. The associated data is not encrypted\&.

.PP
When left undefined, the associated-data parameters are omitted from the function signatures and the associated-data absorption phase is skipped entirely, reducing code size on targets that do not require AD support\&. 
